POST http://localhost:3000/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "user-click",
  "timestamp": "2025-04-16T12:00:00Z",
  "data": {
    "buttonId": "submit-1",
    "userId": 123
  }
}

### ── Mobile API (app-agentiz-mobile-api) ──────────────────────────────────────
@mobileHost = http://localhost:17280
@mobileBase = {{mobileHost}}/api/agentiz/mobile/v1

### Health
GET {{mobileBase}}/healthz

### Login: admin (UserAP) credentials -> JWT bearer token
# @name mobileLogin
POST {{mobileBase}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Current user (reuses the token from the login response)
GET {{mobileBase}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}

### Projects owned by the logged-in user
GET {{mobileBase}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{mobileLogin.response.body.token}}
